  "body": "Hello lovely humans,\n\n[babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types](https://www.npmjs.com/package/babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types) just published its new version 0.2.10.\n\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      State\n    </th>\n    <td>\n      Update :rocket:\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      Dependency\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      New version\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      0.2.10\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      Type\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      devDependency\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n\nThis version is **not covered** by your **current version range**.\n\nWithout accepting this pull request your project will work just like it did before. There might be a bunch of new features, fixes and perf improvements that the maintainers worked on for you though.\n\nI recommend you look into these changes and try to get onto the latest version of babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types.\nGiven that you have a decent test suite, a passing build is a strong indicator that you can take advantage of these changes by merging the proposed change into your project. Otherwise this branch is a great starting point for you to work on the update.\n\nDo you have any ideas how I could improve these pull requests? Did I report anything you think isn’t right?\nAre you unsure about how things are supposed to work?\n\nThere is a collection of [frequently asked questions](https://greenkeeper.io/faq.html) and while I’m just a bot, there is a group of people who are happy to teach me new things. [Let them know](https://github.com/greenkeeperio/greenkeeper/issues/new).\n\nGood luck with your project :sparkles:\n\nYou rock!\n\n:palm_tree:\n\n---\n\nThe new version differs by 16 commits .\n- [`133457a`](https://github.com/oliviertassinari/babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types/commit/133457a6796c17b387e76cb86fa2b8dd1803d1cb) <code>v0.2.10</code>\n- [`ac94f35`](https://github.com/oliviertassinari/babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types/commit/ac94f35cf620d214552098ec4a6d379e8805dbe5) <code>chore(package): update flow-bin to version 0.33.0 (#59)</code>\n- [`bd6ee10`](https://github.com/oliviertassinari/babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types/commit/bd6ee1000c7eedba216bdbbf1b423bd5ccc49909) <code>chore(package): update eslint-plugin-import to version 2.0.0 (#58)</code>\n- [`4b2235c`](https://github.com/oliviertassinari/babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types/commit/4b2235c80dc15d43d04f6af23694ef3c2cdf4baf) <code>Fix .babelrc example configuration with options (#57)</code>\n- [`a35989c`](https://github.com/oliviertassinari/babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types/commit/a35989c8b98aae16b56fc15ff1dec4a6a46f7619) <code>chore(package): update babel-eslint to version 7.0.0 (#56)</code>\n- [`b19fe1c`](https://github.com/oliviertassinari/babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types/commit/b19fe1c25f9bf5f82c951f82326c8a437c0180c9) <code>[README] Simplify the docs</code>\n- [`d124c32`](https://github.com/oliviertassinari/babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types/commit/d124c321a14520506690e76f24f6286105b9ea92) <code>[es6] Add integration tests for this target</code>\n- [`093172e`](https://github.com/oliviertassinari/babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types/commit/093172e75b45cd41f90bc7a1b3f8c02b668beed5) <code>chore(package): update flow-bin to version 0.32.0 (#54)</code>\n- [`a154466`](https://github.com/oliviertassinari/babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types/commit/a154466ea99640ee5c27a78d0c03af2fd7fe5bf5) <code>[README] Explicit the mode</code>\n- [`a4bff76`](https://github.com/oliviertassinari/babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types/commit/a4bff762d3b10a0038685372dffcfbff797dbd10) <code>Merge branch 'master' of github.com:oliviertassinari/babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types</code>\n- [`376ae11`](https://github.com/oliviertassinari/babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types/commit/376ae11fbcc160596471cec05d8256682715bd5d) <code>[core] upgrade the tech stack</code>\n- [`946cbd9`](https://github.com/oliviertassinari/babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types/commit/946cbd993ee9bc6385fdd46b8992a26a6a9150d7) <code>[core] upgrade the tech stack</code>\n- [`4e8b136`](https://github.com/oliviertassinari/babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types/commit/4e8b136bf8aa62bcc260697deaddc388d48bdb67) <code>chore(package): update flow-bin to version 0.31.1 (#48)</code>\n- [`a644287`](https://github.com/oliviertassinari/babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types/commit/a644287cc797ff7656cee34cf1e3a168eedb335f) <code>[Class] Fix an issue with the export syntax (#45)</code>\n- [`1994ebc`](https://github.com/oliviertassinari/babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types/commit/1994ebcaa99586f7f44197f2cc8545c0a0e5e63f) <code>chore(package): update eslint-plugin-react to version 6.0.0 (#44)</code>\n\nThere are 16 commits in total. See the [full diff](https://github.com/oliviertassinari/babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types/compare/33b47c36fc9a19fe964114ce587fa6ed23b9028a...133457a6796c17b387e76cb86fa2b8dd1803d1cb).\n\n---\n\nThis pull request was created by [greenkeeper.io](https://greenkeeper.io/).\n\n<sub>Tired of seeing this sponsor message? :zap: `greenkeeper upgrade`</sub>\n",
